    "claims": [
      "Accepts over- or under-delivery within agreed quantity tolerances",
      "Tolerances suit bulk materials that cannot be measured exactly",
      "Restricts which vendors an item may be bought from",
      "Restricts which customers may buy an item",
      "Sends one purchase request to several vendors and turns the best offer into a purchase order",
      "Blanket sales and purchase orders get a contract validity period and outstanding call-off info",
      "Creates country-specific VAT registration numbers",
      "Automates account assignment and tax rate determination",
      "Shows the actual cross-border flow of goods for EU tax purposes",
      "Auto-generated sales and purchase lists can be filtered, sorted and exported",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
